_(1435)","c":2},{"y":1435,"t":"vassal_start","x":"1435: Ponthieu becomes the duke's vassal.","m":9,"cp":"county-of-ponthieu","cpn":"County of Ponthieu","u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Treaty_of_Arras_(1435)","c":3},{"y":1435,"t":"vassal_start","x":"1435: the county of Boulogne becomes the duke's vassal.","m":9,"cp":"county-of-auvergne","cpn":"County of Auvergne","u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Treaty_of_Arras_(1435)","c":3},{"y":1443,"t":"gain","x":"1443: Luxembourg passes to the duke.","cp":"duchy-of-luxembourg","cpn":"Duchy of Luxembourg","u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Burgundian_Netherlands","c":3},{"y":1469,"t":"occupation_start","x":"1469: Sigismund of Austria pawns his Alsace lands to Charles the Bold.","cp":"house-of-habsburg","cpn":"House of Habsburg","u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Burgundian_Wars","c":3},{"y":1473,"t":"vassal_start","x":"1473: Lorraine becomes a Burgundian protectorate.","cp":"duchy-of-lorraine","cpn":"Duchy of Lorraine","u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Charles_the_Bold","c":3},{"y":1473,"t":"gain","x":"1473: Charles the Bold conquers Guelders.","m":6,"cp":"duchy-of-guelders","cpn":"Duchy of Guelders","u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Charles_the_Bold","c":3},{"y":1474,"t":"occupation_end","x":"1474: Burgundian rule in Alsace collapses.","cp":"house-of-habsburg","cpn":"House of Habsburg","u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Charles_the_Bold","c":2},{"y":1475,"t":"vassal_end","x":"30 November 1475: Charles the Bold invades Lorraine and the protectorate ends in conquest.","m":11,"cp":"duchy-of-lorraine","cpn":"Duchy of Lorraine","u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ren%C3%A9_II,_Duke_of_Lorraine","c":3},{"y":1475,"t":"occupation_start","x":"30 November 1475: Charles occupies Lorraine, taking Nancy.","m":11,"cp":"duchy-of-lorraine","cpn":"Duchy of Lorraine","u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ren%C3%A9_II,_Duke_of_Lorraine","c":3},{"y":1476,"t":"occupation_end","x":"5 October 1476: René II retakes Nancy and the occupation of Lorrai